{"ID":"20240206092410-q3errba","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"false","id":"20240206092410-q3errba","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206092410-q3errba\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206092417-4zyuwl6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240221195403-1xchaat\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240221195357-6crjki0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":" 天葵子","type":"doc","updated":"20240830101557"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206092417-4zyuwl6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206092417-4zyuwl6","updated":"20240206092420"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产安徽、江苏、贵州、湖南等地。\n【性状】\t块根呈不规则短柱状、纺锤状或块状，略弯曲，有的有23短分叉，长13cm，直径0.5"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1cm。表面暗褐色至灰黑色，具不规则的皱纹及须根或须根痕；顶端常有茎叶残基，外被数层黄褐色鞘状鳞片；中部通常较膨大。质较软，易折断，断面皮部类白色，木部黄白色或黄棕色，略显放射状纹理。气微，味甘、微苦辛。\n【性味】\t甘、苦、辛，寒。\n【功效】\t清热解毒，消肿散结。用于痈肿疔疮，乳痈，瘰疬，蛇虫咬伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240206092413-lkgkj8t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206092413-lkgkj8t","updated":"20240206092413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206092413-2xf3e9d.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240221195403-1xchaat","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221195403-1xchaat","updated":"20240708100807"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 585px;","style":"width: 575px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240221195403-zxj5sj3.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 575px;\" parent-style=\"width: 585px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20240708100655-8me80lj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240708100655-8me80lj","updated":"20240708101143"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 438px;","style":"width: 428px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"天葵子7"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/天葵子7-20240708101143-i0r5osl.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 428px;\" parent-style=\"width: 438px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 717px;","style":"width: 707px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"天葵子5"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/天葵子5-20240708101016-6av2dgx.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 707px;\" parent-style=\"width: 717px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240708101016-1zkzcyz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240708101016-1zkzcyz","updated":"20240829171410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 587px;","style":"width: 577px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"天葵子 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/天葵子 1-20240829171404-glhsttf.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL",